# E4-R34 (H04) — the observation-fixture collection is isolated here.

The e4-r24 final-result protocol test spawns a REAL `vitest run` over a
generated, DELIBERATELY-failing fixture (`e4-r24-fixture-*.test.ts`). Those
files are created at runtime, used, and deleted — but if that cleanup is ever
interrupted (crash, sandbox file-limit, kill), a leftover file must NOT be
collected by the next full-repo run.

Keeping them in this directory (outside the root vitest `include` scope and
outside `tsconfig`'s `src`) makes that structurally impossible. The subprocess
runs them through `../observation-vitest.config.ts`, which selects exactly this
directory and wires the production observation reporter.

`.gitkeep` keeps the directory present so the dedicated config always has a
stable home.
